- calms21/
    Adapted from CalMS21 (Sun et al., 2021, https://data.caltech.edu/records/s0vdx-0k302),
    licensed under CC BY 4.0, and shared under CC BY 4.0. Changes: calms21/README.md.

- pair24m/
    Adapted from PAIR-R24M (Marshall et al., 2021), licensed under CC BY 4.0 (see
    pair24m/LICENSE_PAIR-R24M.txt), and shared under CC BY 4.0. Changes: pair24m/README.md.

- mabe22/, deepethogram/labels/, deepethogram/pose_videos/, sbea/keypoints/
    Derived from MABe22 (Sun et al., 2023, https://data.caltech.edu/records/rdsa8-rde65),
    DeepEthogram (Bohnslav et al., 2021, https://github.com/jbohnslav/deepethogram) and
    SBeA (Han et al., 2024, https://github.com/YNCris/SBeA_release). These files remain
    subject to the terms of their original releases and are provided for research use
    with attribution to the original authors. Changes are described in each folder's
    README.

If you use any part of this dataset, please cite BehaVERT and the original dataset
(see README.md).
